<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Njimi</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Njimi was the early capital of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-kanem">Kanem</a> phase of the Kanem-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bornu">Bornu Empire</a>, located north-east of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lake-chad">Lake Chad</a>. It functioned as a commercial and administrative hub of the kingdom. The capital later shifted to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ngazargamu">Ngazargamu</a> in Bornu in response to political pressures.</p></div>
